{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06I1", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3f4a1fba75b27dea09260f92a907e7ce2fc866103225685fda5a6f27481eba6d", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nA morphism of predeformation categories induces a map on tangent spaces.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:47d098ad7f1ba27fc5c27b9c9f59f4a7607a6b14eb39c53cabf187512b9e3453", "unit_id": "tag:06I1:prose-0003"}
{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "06I1", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\varphi : \\mathcal{F} \\to \\mathcal{G}$", "MATH_0002": "$d \\varphi : T \\mathcal{F} \\to T \\mathcal{G}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\varphi$", "MATH_0004": "$\\overline{\\varphi}: \\overline{\\mathcal{F}} \\to \\overline{\\mathcal{G}}$", "MATH_0005": "$A = k[\\epsilon]$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-differential}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c143974c4cd63dc9664cf571ab28bd53cf3a6bc1c1dd3fffd2fc4a48285402ac", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:000425f3659c73fa8e431e501d7a08f45fabfbfc3f694919a596d78d715b268a", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism predeformation\ncategories. The\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001>differential <MATH_0002> of <MATH_0003><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>\nis the map obtained by evaluating the morphism of functors\n<MATH_0004>\nat <MATH_0005>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f234f73600dbbe84757934ff990548ca208268aa20acdb8179a41cdea386383f", "unit_id": "tag:06II:statement"}
{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06I1", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\varphi : \\mathcal{F} \\to \\mathcal{G}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\overline{\\mathcal{F}}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\overline{\\mathcal{G}}$", "MATH_0004": "$d \\varphi : T \\mathcal{F} \\to T \\mathcal{G}$", "MATH_0005": "$k$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-k-linear-differential}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:9511ce92ada773fa62c8eeded6ad35f2527023253563b17a114af520bcaf2cbe", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:956d4a659b6201db178ba8ffa5c6736b74c213a4f0c13371d4fcca98f7a16841", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of predeformation\ncategories. Assume <MATH_0002> and <MATH_0003> both\nsatisfy (S2). Then <MATH_0004> is <MATH_0005>-linear.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:bbd739a52e9db3cc0d0cdc578f08d01fa6f858f85ade3dbd0eb3354a65a1a6b3", "unit_id": "tag:06IJ:statement"}
{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06I1", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\overline{\\mathcal{F}}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\overline{\\mathcal{G}}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-tangent-space-vector-space}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-tangent-space-functor}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-morphism-tangent-spaces}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:174e5b59ab7331c579016ad3f9a018794e2e5a60931afc354dc24aa670e717dc", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d2f9972cc7eee735a4a20602f1f7ac2654639897846b4a926ceab06ff0eb6888", "source_text": "In the proof of\nLemma <REF_0001>\nwe have seen that <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002>\nsatisfy the hypotheses of\nLemma <REF_0002>.\nHence the lemma follows from\nLemma <REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:bf16556245d7b98a410b1e4e0bb15bb8a6edfb8fb7a26a99b9f4cb0c8b07a8f1", "unit_id": "tag:06IJ:proof"}
{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "remark", "parent_tag": "06I1", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{C}_\\Lambda$", "MATH_0003": "$x \\in \\Ob(\\mathcal{F}(k))$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{F}_x$", "MATH_0005": "$$\nT_x\\mathcal{F} = T\\mathcal{F}_x\n$$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0007": "$x$", "MATH_0008": "$\\varphi : \\mathcal{F} \\to \\mathcal{G}$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{C}_\\Lambda$", "MATH_0010": "$x \\in \\Ob(\\mathcal{F}(k))$", "MATH_0011": "$\\varphi_x: \\mathcal{F}_x \\to \\mathcal{G}_{\\varphi(x)}$", "MATH_0012": "$d_x \\varphi : T_x \\mathcal{F} \\to T_{\\varphi(x)} \\mathcal{G}$", "MATH_0013": "$\\varphi$", "MATH_0014": "$x$", "MATH_0015": "$d \\varphi_x: T \\mathcal{F}_x \\to T \\mathcal{G}_{\\varphi(x)}$", "MATH_0016": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0017": "$\\mathcal{G}$", "MATH_0018": "$k$", "MATH_0019": "$d_x \\varphi : T_x \\mathcal{F} \\to T_{\\varphi(x)} \\mathcal{G}$", "MATH_0020": "$k$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{remark-localize-cofibered-groupoid}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-S1-S2-localize}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-k-linear-differential}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{remark}\n\\label{remark-tangent-space-cofibered-groupoid}\n", "suffix": "\\end{remark}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:32548c78c0464a60a0446551c7e0899dfd493488150fa1f8a8dfe65bc6066ad9", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4b43a7ff2f34343e0b6bcad17132c253d19f89a17ed913fa0d464f1e359d47c6", "source_text": "We can globalize the notions of tangent space and differential to arbitrary\ncategories cofibered in groupoids as follows. Let <MATH_0001> be a category\ncofibered in groupoids over <MATH_0002>, and let\n<MATH_0003>. As in\nRemark <REF_0001>,\nwe get a predeformation category <MATH_0004>. We define\n<MATH_0005>\nto be the <TEXTITOPEN_0001>tangent space of <MATH_0006> at <MATH_0007><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>. If\n<MATH_0008> is a morphism of categories cofibered\nin groupoids over <MATH_0009> and <MATH_0010>,\nthen there is an induced morphism\n<MATH_0011>. We define the\n<TEXTITOPEN_0002>differential\n<MATH_0012>\nof <MATH_0013> at <MATH_0014><TEXTITCLOSE_0002> to be the map\n<MATH_0015>.\nIf both <MATH_0016> and <MATH_0017> satisfy (S2) then\nall of these tangent spaces have a natural <MATH_0018>-vector space structure\nand all the differentials\n<MATH_0019>\nare <MATH_0020>-linear (use\nLemmas <REF_0002> and <REF_0003>).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:1e8b1a15caaa4bc3cf3be65828047c12131bb2a79374a3dce369b297080c11eb", "unit_id": "tag:06IK:statement"}
